{"id":"vod_bf_28484","vodId":"28484","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"日常系的异能战斗","name_cn":"日常系的异能战斗","date":"2014-01-01","year":"2014","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20230424-29/752bb2f9e3515cfb0683b04fe01c3086.jpg"},"summary":"泉光高中文艺部生活着一群性格各异的青春男女，其中高中二年级的安藤寿来（冈本信彦 配音）是一个典型的中二病，他每天梦想拥有超能力来拯救世界，谁想到不切实际的愿望竟然真的实现了。在毫无征兆的日子里，安藤掌握了“黑焰”的能力，其他成员也各有所长，如操纵时间的隐藏宅女神崎灯代（ 山崎遥 配音）、掌握自然属性的天然少女栉川鸠子（早见沙织 配音）、可把一切事物还原的腐女部长高梨彩弓（种田梨沙 配音）、可自由创造物质和空间的文艺部顾问老师的侄女姬木千冬（山下七海 配音）。可是现实世界没有邪恶敌人对付怎么办？那就只好自娱自乐喽……　　本片根据望公太的轻小说改编。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2025-04-02 17:58:26","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/richangxideyinengzhandou/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/richangxideyinengzhandou/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/richangxideyinengzhandou/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf4.com/video/richangxideyinengzhandou/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf5.com/video/richangxideyinengzhandou/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf4.com/video/richangxideyinengzhandou/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/richangxideyinengzhandou/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241025oivFEoAmindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/richangxideyinengzhandou/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/richangxideyinengzhandou/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241025ehaoHkPsindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241025nABjsScEindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"}]}]